/// @return A new plot holding the series.
/// @throws DMError of kind DMErrorKindInvalidArgument (C++ `std::invalid_argument`): If the coordinates are empty or differ in length, or `type` is not one of the three codes.
/// @see RPlot(std::vector<double>
