///
/// C++ applies the default arguments of the parameters after the first 2.
///
/// @param data Observations; all must be finite.
/// @param bins Number of bins (default 10).
/// @return A new plot holding one Bar series.
/// @throws DMError of kind DMErrorKindInvalidArgument (C++ `std::invalid_argument`): For empty/non-finite data, zero bins, or a range/bin width that cannot be represented as a finite positive double.
