/// @endcode
///
/// References
///
/// - NIST DLMF3.7(v), Runge-Kutta Method, https://dlmf.nist.gov/3.7.v.
/// - J. R. Dormand and P. J. Prince(1980), A family of embedded Runge-Kutta formulae, doi:10.1016/0771-050X(80)90013-3. Native controller does not reuse FSAL and rejects nonconforming tiny trials.
///
/// C++ applies the default arguments of the parameters after the first 0.
///
/// @throws DMError of kind DMErrorKindInvalidArgument (C++ `std::invalid_argument`): If any complete method/numerical control fails.
/// @see options()
- (instancetype)init;
+ (instancetype)new;

