/// @throws DMError of kind DMErrorKindLengthError (C++ `std::length_error`): Input, actual event, history or capacity policy exceeded.
/// @throws DMError of kind DMErrorKindArithmeticError (C++ `std::overflow_error`): Farthest distance cannot be represented as finite double.
